{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/837176-new-edition-of-kult-and-a-kickstarter","id":837176,"title":"New edition of Kult! And a kickstarter.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-25T13:05:37-08:00","id":837176,"title":"New edition of Kult! And a kickstarter.","content":"I hope this is kosher with forum rules, I thought as white wolf have made cooperation's with Kult in the past, probably.<br /> <br /> It is finally happening, after all of these years, a new edition of Kult.<br /> <span style=\"color:red\">*snip*</span><br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kult_%28role-playing_game%29\" target=\"_blank\">Kult (role-playing game) - Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia</a><br /> <br /> To me Kult is the definitive modern setting horror RPG. With great dark and disturbing themes as well as actual maturity to it. It will be good too see a new edition as I can see many ways it can grow, especially in the area of what actually happens when a person starts to really regain their divinity and the horror aspects and hubris in that rather then the victim aspects. And it is good they are giving it a new system as the old one was never particularly suited (although entirely understandable how it came to be knowing the times and history of \u00c4ventyrsspel.). Kickstarter funded fully and got all original stretch goals in 12 minutes hehe. Yeah I think its safe to say this have been wanted for a long time.I would recommend for any WOD/CofD fan to check it out.Which isnt the same as to say I would recommend backing the kickstarter, pre-order is pre-order with all the risks it carry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 02-25-2016, 05:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/724-palp","name":"Palp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar724_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T14:03:54-08:00","id":837207,"title":"","content":"Awww... what about the twelves pages of pictures of guns with functionally identical stats? That was the best bit. Well, aside from martial arts having an inexplicable magic system.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the notice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T14:55:23-08:00","id":837230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Palp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/837176-new-edition-of-kult-and-a-kickstarter#post837176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope this is kosher with forum rules, I thought as white wolf have made cooperation's with Kult in the past, probably.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:red\">Linking to the Kickstarter is advertising, which is against the rules, but discussing it is fine. I went ahead and removed the link from your post rather than closing the thread. The admins will sometimes give permission to link things like that if you ask them.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T00:57:37-08:00","id":837430,"title":"","content":"The background of Kult is interesting but to be an ordinary mortal human PC is too boring. I would rather to be a supernatural WoD creature or a D&amp;D champion. My gameplay isn't about investigation, I don't play &quot;Call of Chulthu&quot; but I want my PC to kickass monsters. I don't want a survival horror but a monster hunt. <br /> <br /> I will say it with other words: I want to be an action hero PC, nor a horror movie final girl or a private eye who investiges about Lovecraft myths. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T01:00:32-08:00","id":837433,"title":"","content":"Backed, mostly for nostalgia reasons","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T04:20:46-08:00","id":837471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/837176-new-edition-of-kult-and-a-kickstarter?p=837430#post837430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The background of Kult is interesting but to be an ordinary mortal human PC is too boring. I would rather to be a supernatural WoD creature or a D&amp;D champion. My gameplay isn't about investigation, I don't play &quot;Call of Chulthu&quot; but I want my PC to kickass monsters. I don't want a survival horror but a monster hunt.<br /> <br /> I will say it with other words: I want to be an action hero PC, nor a horror movie final girl or a private eye who investiges about Lovecraft myths.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>There are no ordinary mortal humans in Kult, You are a trapped god with unimaginable power waiting to be unleashed as you reject the prison of perceived reality (through large amounts of insanity <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />). IIRC there was rules for vampires and werewolfs, but those where probably trapped in the prison as well. Or who knows, maybe infestations by Gaia. Otherwise you have the official crossover treatment, Jail of Night from White Wolfs inphobia magazine, although annoyingly the download for that seems to be down.<br /> <br /> Although previous editions did focus mostly on the lower tiers of play, it would be nice if this new edition also delve into the upper ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":724,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/724-palp","user":"Palp","date":". 02-26-2016, 07:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/724-palp","name":"Palp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar724_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T06:34:14-08:00","id":837512,"title":"","content":"PCs from Kult are relatively weaker than ones from another games, without &quot;superpowers&quot;. There is magic, but too dificult to be used by PCs. In Kult most of time you are investigating until the monster appears and then to run away. My wish is to kickass Pinhead and the rest of cenobites, or somethin like Clive Baker's Jericho videogame. I use the splatterpunk background to emphasize the light of hope and faith. <br /> <br /> * I have just readen the facebook page and it tells there are three types of archetypes: sleepers, awares and the elightened (the &quot;superhero&quot;, only one in the corebook, the death mage).<br /> <br /> * I don't imagine all lictos like white-skin fat boys but more like lord fays with splatter punk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}